<!--
  LINE Messages' launcher mark on the glasses: the LINE speech bubble as an outline, with
  the word LINE inside it. Both come from the Simple Icons "LINE" geometry (CC0 1.0,
  https://simpleicons.org): the bubble is its outline, fitted with the stroke's half-width
  to spare so nothing is clipped; the letters are the centre lines of its letter outlines,
  at their original size and spacing. The logo's letters are closed outlines about a unit
  thick, and the glasses draw every path as one 1.7-unit stroke, so tracing both edges of
  each letter closed them into a blob at 36 px; one line per limb keeps the word readable.
  LINE is a trademark of LY Corporation; the mark identifies the service this plugin
  talks to, nothing more.
-->
